### Trip planner Tests
GET http://localhost:7071/api/candidateMatch

###

### Get all candidates
GET http://localhost:7071/api/candidateMatch/candidates

###

### Get all candidates filtered
GET http://localhost:7071/api/candidateMatch/candidates?category=DEVOPS

###

### get by id
GET http://localhost:7071/api/candidateMatch/candidates/1

###

### Create candidate
POST http://localhost:7071/api/candidateMatch/candidates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test El-Mir",
  "phone": "13415801",
  "educationBackground": "Datamatiker",
  "candidateSkills": []
}

###

### Update
PUT http://localhost:7071/api/candidateMatch/candidates/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Mariam El-Mir Updated",
    "phone": "123000",
    "educationBackground": "Datamatiker - Updated",
    "candidateSkills": []
}


###

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:7071/api/candidateMatch/candidates/2

###

###
PUT http://localhost:7071/api/candidateMatch/candidates/1/skills/1

###


